    <p>My coursework spans data structures, algorithms, computer organization, logic design, and artificial intelligence. Alongside classes, I'm working through The Odin Project and developing a weight and nutrition tracking project.</p>
    <h2>Research interests</h2>
    <p>I'm exploring where I can contribute to computer science research. I'm interested in applying programming to practical questions, implementing and evaluating ideas, and learning how a research team develops and tests its work. I'm open to discussing projects that fit my current skills and give me room to grow.</p>
    <h2>Experience</h2>
    <p>During my IT internship at Indesore Trading (May–August 2026), I provided technical support, troubleshot hardware and software issues, and assisted with IT infrastructure management.</p>
    <p>I'm interested in full-stack development and data science. I want to build applications from the user interface through the backend and database, and explore how data analysis and visualization can help people understand patterns and make informed decisions.</p>
